'''Abduction''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[2025 Halloween Box]] in the [[Halloween Event 2025|2025 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
The blade is decorated with an imagery of a UFO, standing out due to its bright neon green shade. There is a silhouette of what appears to be a person being abducted by a spaceship, hence its name. Both the guard and handle of this knife are in the shade of black. 

